# shamefully-hoist is intentionally NOT set (removed — DIA-002).
# pnpm's default public-hoist-pattern (*eslint*, *prettier*) keeps the
# tools this monorepo imports at root (e.g. typescript-eslint, used by
# eslint.base.config.js) working with the isolated layout. Verified gates
# pass without it, host + container, turbo --force (no cache):
#   pnpm install && pnpm lint && pnpm typecheck && pnpm test
